# AI Integration Rules

## Where LLM runs

LLM MAY run only in the **worker pipeline** (e.g. cluster → signal analysis, brief script).

LLM MUST NOT run on:

- Per-user API requests
- Raw unfiltered firehose of every post
- Critical auth / billing / quota enforcement

## Cost funnel

Prefer:

```text
Raw → rules/filter → dedupe/similarity → clusters → LLM on clusters only → Signals
```

Never send all raw items to the LLM.

## Output contract

- Structured JSON (schema-validated) before persist
- Must separate confirmed_fact / market_interpretation / opinion / rumor
- Must not invent facts; empty `confirmed_facts` is OK

## Fallback

If LLM fails or key missing: deterministic heuristic analyze + quality gate still runs.
Degrade gracefully; do not fail the whole ingest cycle.

## Prompts

Keep prompts in pipeline modules (or a dedicated prompts module), versioned by behavior change.
Reuse — do not copy-paste divergent prompts per call site.

## Observability

Log model name, cluster size, success/failure, and token/cost proxies when available.
Do not log full secrets; truncate sensitive payloads if needed.
